(7688490, 1259062, 66597, '<td valign="top">I feel like this is just a tad underexposed, needs a bit of curves work, and a noise reduction filter. But mainly, I''m wishing there was a distinct point of interest. That being said, I commend the choice of an unusual subject to photograph. No vote, comment only</td>', 'I feel like this is just a tad underexposed, needs a bit of curves work, and a noise reduction filter. But mainly, I''m wishing there was a distinct point of interest. That being said, I commend the choice of an unusual subject to photograph. No vote, comment only', '2021-03-02 20:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7688491, 1259003, 66597, '<td valign="top">Am compelled by this image, particularly with the soft, almost ethereal processing, which works well with the absurdity of a rock balancing here (I''m assuming this is an art museum?) I like this a lot. Hope it scores well. No vote, comment only</td>', 'Am compelled by this image, particularly with the soft, almost ethereal processing, which works well with the absurdity of a rock balancing here (I''m assuming this is an art museum?) I like this a lot. Hope it scores well. No vote, comment only', '2021-03-02 20:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
