(7688493, 1258910, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft colors and processing. There''s a touch of noise in the b/g, but not distractingly so. There are a couple of hot spots on the tulip as well, but I actually rather appreciate that they make this look natural. A very nice image. No vote, comment only</td>', 'Lovely soft colors and processing. There''s a touch of noise in the b/g, but not distractingly so. There are a couple of hot spots on the tulip as well, but I actually rather appreciate that they make this look natural. A very nice image. No vote, comment only', '2021-03-02 20:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
