(7688846, 1259189, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fascinating combination of great dynamism with a calm close up top and away.  The trains are powerfully depicted, both in the obvious speed and in the graphic design that also includes the center walkway and the station overhangs.  The clamorous lights of the city along and beyond continue the heightened sensation of boisterous energy.  Finally, a blue mist fills the sky, enveloping a ghostly building.  You could say that the overall composition is one of four triangles meeting at their collective vanishing point-- the train and extending avenue, the left and right buildings and that misty blue at top, the blues there gently echoing the brash blues in the foreground.  Altogether exciting.<br/>One of three personal favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'A fascinating combination of great dynamism with a calm close up top and away.  The trains are powerfully depicted, both in the obvious speed and in the graphic design that also includes the center walkway and the station overhangs.  The clamorous lights of the city along and beyond continue the heightened sensation of boisterous energy.  Finally, a blue mist fills the sky, enveloping a ghostly building.  You could say that the overall composition is one of four triangles meeting at their collective vanishing point-- the train and extending avenue, the left and right buildings and that misty blue at top, the blues there gently echoing the brash blues in the foreground.  Altogether exciting.One of three personal favorites of the challenge.', '2021-03-07 15:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7688847, 1259488, 173844, '<td valign="top">A whodunit!  Our calm, stunning detective is taken to waters edge and is now pondering the proliferation of clues.  The scene is busy in an enchanting manner, enchanting as a result of a narrow palette and all the delicate contrasts.  It''s a still moment in winter that envelopes everything in timelessness.  The trees'' reflections are beautiful.  The spidery holes in the ice suggest an extraterrestrial component, but let''s not go there.  Enjoyable, compelling artistry.<br/>One of three personal favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'A whodunit!  Our calm, stunning detective is taken to waters edge and is now pondering the proliferation of clues.  The scene is busy in an enchanting manner, enchanting as a result of a narrow palette and all the delicate contrasts.  It''s a still moment in winter that envelopes everything in timelessness.  The trees'' reflections are beautiful.  The spidery holes in the ice suggest an extraterrestrial component, but let''s not go there.  Enjoyable, compelling artistry.One of three personal favorites of the challenge.', '2021-03-07 16:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7688886, 1259429, 173844, '<td valign="top">So very lovely.  Once you jettison the economic overtones of gold and silver, and the attendant lust and perfidy they inspire, they''re a terrific color combination.  It can be said that there''s copper in here as well but, what am I, a geologist?  The pintails alone are handsome, but they also function as the charge that energizes the entirety of this harmonious scene.  I like how the background floats, pardon the pun, in abstraction. This includes the ducks'' reflections.<br/>One of three personal favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'So very lovely.  Once you jettison the economic overtones of gold and silver, and the attendant lust and perfidy they inspire, they''re a terrific color combination.  It can be said that there''s copper in here as well but, what am I, a geologist?  The pintails alone are handsome, but they also function as the charge that energizes the entirety of this harmonious scene.  I like how the background floats, pardon the pun, in abstraction. This includes the ducks'' reflections.One of three personal favorites of the challenge.', '2021-03-07 22:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
