(7688931, 1259575, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> I like it, but why is it so small?  Only 680 on the long side ... you have 1200.  Good luck in the challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, huh.  ???  Came back around to look at a few after the challenge and now I''m seeing this full size.  So I take back my sizing comment above.  :-}  Now I want to look at this on my laptop (where I was voting from) and check something.  I''m wondering if I have something set that auto resizes to the screen real-estate available on that computer / browser.<br/> <br/>I am curious; is this a spot on your property or did you happen across it somewhere else?  Is the dust fabricated (certainly doesn''t look like it) or has it really been sitting there long enough to accumulate?  Inquiring minds want to know.  :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: I like it, but why is it so small?  Only 680 on the long side ... you have 1200.  Good luck in the challenge.   Well, huh.  ???  Came back around to look at a few after the challenge and now I''m seeing this full size.  So I take back my sizing comment above.  :-}  Now I want to look at this on my laptop (where I was voting from) and check something.  I''m wondering if I have something set that auto resizes to the screen real-estate available on that computer / browser. I am curious; is this a spot on your property or did you happen across it somewhere else?  Is the dust fabricated (certainly doesn''t look like it) or has it really been sitting there long enough to accumulate?  Inquiring minds want to know.  :-)', '2021-03-08 09:07:54.000000', NULL, 0),
