(7689503, 1259269, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is possibly the coolest overhead drone shot I''ve ever seen.  Took me forever to figure out what I was looking at!  Congrats Jake, truly impressive!</td>', 'This is possibly the coolest overhead drone shot I''ve ever seen.  Took me forever to figure out what I was looking at!  Congrats Jake, truly impressive!', '2021-03-15 03:28:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689842, 1259534, 70270, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one.  The texture on the waves is lovely; so is the color palette.  And that spot of sunlight shining on the water and in the clouds makes the whole thing pop.</td>', 'I really liked this one.  The texture on the waves is lovely; so is the color palette.  And that spot of sunlight shining on the water and in the clouds makes the whole thing pop.', '2021-03-19 11:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689888, 1259534, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah.  I tried to mimic something like this just recently.  Didn''t quite get the results you did.  :-)  I guess if I had any nit I would like to see it with a little less sky.  But, it''s very cool as is.</td>', 'Oh yeah.  I tried to mimic something like this just recently.  Didn''t quite get the results you did.  :-)  I guess if I had any nit I would like to see it with a little less sky.  But, it''s very cool as is.', '2021-03-19 21:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7692098, 1258929, 30049, '<td valign="top">That setup seems to get some pretty good detail.  Too bad you couldn''t double that shutter speed to tighten up the motion blur a bit.  I do like a little motion in the wings - that''s actually an interesting addition.</td>', 'That setup seems to get some pretty good detail.  Too bad you couldn''t double that shutter speed to tighten up the motion blur a bit.  I do like a little motion in the wings - that''s actually an interesting addition.', '2021-04-19 22:14:55.000000', NULL, 0),
